Steps to Run:
1-Database Configuration: Ensure your MySQL (or any other database) is set up and running.
2-JDBC Connection: Modify your JDBC connection URL, username, and password as needed in the servlet code.
3-Compile and Deploy: After writing and configuring your servlets, deploy them to your servlet container (e.g., Tomcat).
4-Access URLs: You can now access:
5-http://localhost:8080/HotelManagement/index.jsp for the home page.
6-http://localhost:8080/HotelManagement/addBooking.jsp to add a new booking.
7-http://localhost:8080/HotelManagement/viewBooking to view all bookings.
